    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "21 Rowan House is a modern and bright first-floor studio apartment, ideally situated within the highly sought-after and convenient Mespil Estate.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hall with a large storage area, suitable for a variety of uses, including as a home office or additional storage. In some cases, owners in Rowan House have incorporated this space into the open-plan living area, which features a fully fitted modern kitchen and benefits from a south-facing aspect overlooking the central landscaped grounds of the development. The bathroom is located just off the entrance hall.\r\n\r\nSituated on Sussex Road, 21 Rowan House enjoys a prime location just a stone’s throw from Fitzwilliam Square and St. Stephen’s Green. Within easy walking distance of Dublin’s Central Business District, Baggot Street, Ballsbridge and Donnybrook, residents can enjoy an abundance of restaurants, coffee shops, theatres, museums and much more on their doorstep. Transport links are excellent, with convenient access to nearby bus services, the Luas and the DART.\r\n\r\nThis highly sought-after location is sure to appeal to purchasers seeking a stylish city residence or an attractive investment opportunity in the heart of Dublin 4."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall\r\nOffice (1.22m x 2.12m) \r\nStudio/Living Area (4.77m x 5.44m max) open planning living area with refurbished kitchen.\r\nShower Room (2.12m x 1.73m) fully tiled with shower, WC and wash hand basin"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tA super Ballsbridge address, a short walk from St Stephen's Green\r\n•\tSouth-facing aspect overlooking the well-maintained landscaped grounds within the development \r\n•\tGas-fired central heating\r\n•\tResident parking\r\n•\tPrivate indoor swimming pool featuring a 20 m pool, sauna, and steam room, available for residents and members (subject to change).\r\n•\tSecure bicycle storage facility\r\n•\tService charge: €1,498.36\r\n•\tManagement company: Petra Management"
      },
      {
